Package: ReversibleLetterOperatorFigures
Title: Reproducibility Materials for Reversible-Letter Rotation Judgments
Version: 1.1.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("Deusa Priscila da Silva", "Resque", role = "aut"),
    person("Antonio", "Pereira", role = c("aut", "cre"))
  )
Description: Public reproducibility materials for the Cortex submission on
    reversible-letter rotation judgments, including aggregate outputs,
    figure-generation code, validation tests, restricted-data schema, and
    inferential model specifications.
